1
00:00:00,964 --> 00:00:05,741
- Are you dissatisfied with me?
- Yes, I am.

2
00:00:07,095 --> 00:00:11,433
You are? Then tell me. I'm ready to listen.

3
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:13,420
Your daughter Hae Yoon is a great woman.

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,945
And I, your son in law, am a man of good sense.

5
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:18,085
- So?
- Trust me.

6
00:00:18,085 --> 00:00:20,720
We keep fighting preparing for this wedding.

7
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,734
You're a big reason we always fight.

8
00:00:23,159 --> 00:00:25,454
It's not just me!

9
00:00:25,489 --> 00:00:27,886
You think your mom isn't part of it?

10
00:00:27,886 --> 00:00:30,205
I'll talk to my mom.
Don't worry about that.

11
00:00:30,205 --> 00:00:32,778
So I want you to treat me as your son in law.

12
00:00:33,842 --> 00:00:36,689
The reason I was so blunt with you
is because I thought of you as a son.

13
00:00:36,689 --> 00:00:40,082
- Did that bother you?
- A son-in-law can't be your son.

14
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:41,605
And a daughter-in-law can't be my mom's daughter.

15
00:00:41,849 --> 00:00:43,788
Let's not be hypocritical.

16
00:00:44,198 --> 00:00:46,221
Are you saying I'm hypocritical?

17
00:00:46,221 --> 00:00:48,636
No. People say what they don't mean.

18
00:00:48,636 --> 00:00:53,179
They say one thing but act resentful or differently.

19
00:00:53,179 --> 00:00:55,793
The truth is they can't win their kids.

20
00:00:55,793 --> 00:00:58,652
I know you're different from them.

21
00:00:59,222 --> 00:01:03,239
So all I have to do is to trust you from now on?

22
00:01:03,577 --> 00:01:04,959
Yeah.

23
00:01:06,367 --> 00:01:11,831
Fine. I'll decide if I can trust you or not after you solve this problem.

24
00:01:11,831 --> 00:01:13,831
I'd trust you if you were my son.

25
00:01:13,831 --> 00:01:17,432
But you said you can't be my son.
How can I trust other people so easily?

26
00:01:17,432 --> 00:01:19,311
I can't do that.

27
00:01:25,795 --> 00:01:30,938
Then I'll set up the date again after you submit the evidence.

28
00:01:30,938 --> 00:01:32,918
All rise.

29
00:01:38,098 --> 00:01:40,052
So he's the new lawyer?

30
00:01:41,702 --> 00:01:46,241
Hi, I'm Jun Sang Jin. Contact me when you need me.

31
00:01:46,241 --> 00:01:49,042
- I'm specialized in divorce cases. - You're kind of brazen.

32
00:01:49,042 --> 00:01:51,792
Not as much as you are.

33
00:01:51,792 --> 00:01:52,886
I'll see you at home.

34
00:01:52,886 --> 00:01:55,315
I'm not going to make food for you anymore.
Eat it at Yuri's house.

35
00:01:55,315 --> 00:01:57,660
So you can take a picture of me as evidence?

36
00:01:57,660 --> 00:02:01,223
Feel free to go. I already have enough pictures for the evidence.

37
00:02:02,675 --> 00:02:04,488
Wait.

38
00:02:06,129 --> 00:02:08,803
I'll leave the house like you want so pack my stuff.

39
00:02:09,532 --> 00:02:13,199
Why do I pack your stuff? I'm not your wife anymore.

40
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:16,597
Do I have to go there only to pack my stuff?
Can't you just do it?

41
00:02:17,373 --> 00:02:19,068
What are you going to tell Tae Hyun?

42
00:02:19,068 --> 00:02:21,247
Do you want me to tell him?
We can tell him together.

43
00:02:21,247 --> 00:02:23,342
- I'll do it first.
- Then let's do it together.

44
00:02:24,236 --> 00:02:26,978
You asked me so you can do what I don't want to do, didn't you?

45
00:02:26,978 --> 00:02:31,147
You're right. I'm being so gentle.
I'm warning you what I'm going to do.

46
00:02:43,309 --> 00:02:44,329
It's snowing.

47
00:02:44,329 --> 00:02:47,396
It's the first snow this year.
All the couples must be going crazy.

48
00:02:47,396 --> 00:02:48,580
I Know.

49
00:02:49,083 --> 00:02:53,042
You're a couple too. Feel bad that you're with me now.

50
00:03:22,559 --> 00:03:24,956
Should I just fight with her?

51
00:03:24,956 --> 00:03:27,884
She's not going to kill me though.

52
00:03:36,015 --> 00:03:38,149
Who's there?

53
00:03:44,497 --> 00:03:46,883
I'm calling the police.

54
00:03:46,883 --> 00:03:49,325
No. I already called the police.

55
00:03:49,325 --> 00:03:52,305
Why would you call the police?

56
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,410
It's so cold. Why didn't you open the door?

57
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:00,539
What are you doing?

58
00:04:00,539 --> 00:04:03,585
You have nowhere to go. You can't sleep here.

59
00:04:03,585 --> 00:04:07,043
- I'm not going to your house though.
- You're not going.

60
00:04:07,043 --> 00:04:10,747
Can I not? I'm kind of scared to go to my house.

61
00:04:10,747 --> 00:04:13,069
Yay.
Then let's go.

62
00:04:13,069 --> 00:04:16,048
- That was so easy.
- I'm actually a very difficult man.

63
00:04:16,476 --> 00:04:18,397
- What are you doing?
- I'm holding your bag.

64
00:04:18,397 --> 00:04:20,422
It's okay. It's not heavy at all.

65
00:04:20,422 --> 00:04:22,063
It's okay. I'll hold it.

66
00:04:22,063 --> 00:04:24,167
How do you shut the door? I'll do it for you.

67
00:04:24,167 --> 00:04:26,600
I should turn on the security system, right?

68
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:29,099
What are you trying to be? A prince?

69
00:04:29,674 --> 00:04:31,949
How did you know? Women like that.

70
00:04:31,949 --> 00:04:36,129
They like to feel protected by a man.
You like that too, don't you?

71
00:04:36,129 --> 00:04:38,406
- Your heart fluttered, didn't it?
- Did you bring your motorcycle?

72
00:04:38,406 --> 00:04:41,453
No. It's snowing now.
It's too dangerous to ride it now.

73
00:04:43,134 --> 00:04:46,111
I didn't go through menopause yet.

74
00:04:48,145 --> 00:04:50,845
You like me now? Wow, you're easy.

75
00:04:50,845 --> 00:04:56,428
I didn't know how easy you are. That's not fun.
You're just like young women.

76
00:04:56,428 --> 00:04:58,586
You should be different
from them since you're old.

77
00:04:58,586 --> 00:05:00,980
I felt for you all of sudden.

78
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:06,284
I know how lonely you are. You're doing
this to get attention.

79
00:05:06,895 --> 00:05:10,985
I'm not that great woman.
I know how that feels to be lonely.

80
00:05:10,985 --> 00:05:13,259
Go first. I'll follow you
after shutting the door.

81
00:05:13,259 --> 00:05:16,555
Let's start over...
with holding hands.

82
00:05:24,753 --> 00:05:27,767
You're so funny. You rejected
me twice in one day.

83
00:05:27,767 --> 00:05:30,562
You know what? I at least give it
a shot even if I get rejected.

84
00:05:30,562 --> 00:05:35,290
You'll just be a lost soul wailing.

85
00:05:45,101 --> 00:05:47,676
[Jung Hoon]

86
00:06:13,693 --> 00:06:15,493
What are you doing here?

87
00:06:22,611 --> 00:06:25,381
Don't get us wrong.
We met because of Dong Bi.

88
00:06:25,381 --> 00:06:27,639
I didn't ask you anything.

89
00:06:28,010 --> 00:06:30,447
You can go, Sang Jin.
Thank you.

90
00:06:31,854 --> 00:06:34,522
You left while I went to get my car.

91
00:06:34,522 --> 00:06:36,297
You're so funny.

92
00:06:36,297 --> 00:06:38,615
It's kind of hard to meet all three of us like this.
Would you like a drink?

93
00:06:38,615 --> 00:06:42,365
I had to go. Would I leave if it weren't that bad?

94
00:06:42,365 --> 00:06:46,115
Until when are you going to do that?
Why didn't you answer my phone?

95
00:06:46,115 --> 00:06:48,048
You were too happy to get the phone
because you were with him?

96
00:06:48,696 --> 00:06:51,095
- What did I do wrong?
- I said you can go.

97
00:06:51,095 --> 00:06:55,555
I will leave. It seems like
you two need to talk more.

98
00:06:56,922 --> 00:06:58,348
You're mad again!

99
00:06:58,348 --> 00:07:02,590
Fine. I got mad! I have a
clear reason why I got mad.

100
00:07:02,590 --> 00:07:04,906
But what are you?

101
00:07:09,153 --> 00:07:12,640
I can understand why he got mad. Let him
go tonight and talk to him tomorrow.

102
00:07:25,351 --> 00:07:26,912
[Hae Yoon]

103
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:35,290
He's not answering my call.

104
00:07:35,490 --> 00:07:38,135
Would you if you were him? How many times
did you ignore that bastard's calls?

105
00:07:38,154 --> 00:07:39,542
I wouldn't answer the phone either.

106
00:07:39,542 --> 00:07:42,086
Don't call him a bastard.
Only I can call him that.

107
00:07:42,086 --> 00:07:44,874
Respect him. He's different from you.

108
00:07:44,874 --> 00:07:49,035
He doesn't get mad just because
I ignored his calls and met you today.

109
00:07:49,748 --> 00:07:53,776
You're making me angry. You weren't
like this when you dated me.

110
00:07:56,639 --> 00:08:00,275
Why is he honking at me?
Go first then.

111
00:08:06,513 --> 00:08:08,225
Stop!

112
00:08:08,225 --> 00:08:10,016
Stop!

113
00:08:24,147 --> 00:08:27,683
Are you crazy? How could you drive like
this when a woman is sitting next to you?

114
00:08:28,075 --> 00:08:29,580
I told him to do that.

115
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:32,142
You're overacting because your girlfriend is in front of you.

116
00:08:32,142 --> 00:08:33,812
Do you think you're being a great man?

117
00:08:33,812 --> 00:08:36,341
Even if she told you to do that,
you should've rejected it.

118
00:08:36,341 --> 00:08:38,765
What if she got hurt?

119
00:08:38,765 --> 00:08:41,237
This is why I don't want
to be involved in other people's drama.

120
00:08:41,237 --> 00:08:44,533
I'll be a loser if I keep staying here.
I'll leave.

121
00:08:49,979 --> 00:08:52,437
Are you out of your mind?
Why did you do that?

122
00:08:52,437 --> 00:08:54,401
If you just leave like that,
when can I see you?

123
00:08:54,401 --> 00:08:56,616
If I got mad, you don't try to
make me feel better.

124
00:08:56,616 --> 00:08:58,948
And you don't answer my calls.

125
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,977
You had three chances.

126
00:09:01,977 --> 00:09:05,300
The first one was when I asked you
where you were with the rice porridge.

127
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:08,895
The second one was when I asked
you about the ring tone.

128
00:09:08,895 --> 00:09:15,256
The third one was when I asked if you knew
Sang Jin would come to Dong Bi's house.

129
00:09:16,538 --> 00:09:18,613
It was all Jun Sang Jin, wasn't it?

130
00:09:19,690 --> 00:09:21,520
Yeah, it was.

131
00:09:22,424 --> 00:09:24,944
You didn't meet him because of Dong Bi.

132
00:09:24,944 --> 00:09:27,020
You met him to get comforted
after you got yell at by my mom.

133
00:09:27,020 --> 00:09:30,802
No. I really did meet him because of Dong Bi.
I even went to the police to report.

134
00:09:30,802 --> 00:09:33,296
I thought he knew how to find
her since he's a lawyer.

135
00:09:33,296 --> 00:09:36,126
You didn't even care if she was gone or not.

136
00:09:36,771 --> 00:09:38,763
Dong Bi went to the U.S because of her brother.

137
00:09:38,763 --> 00:09:41,231
She called me on the day she was gone.

138
00:09:42,212 --> 00:09:44,683
Dong Bi didn't want others
to know about this.

139
00:09:45,471 --> 00:09:48,526
Am I not her friend?
I can't believe her.

140
00:09:48,526 --> 00:09:50,628
Why did she call you but not me?

141
00:09:50,628 --> 00:09:52,563
Are you closer with her more than I am?

142
00:09:52,563 --> 00:09:54,200
Maybe she feels more comfortable with me.

143
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,707
Why does she feel like that?

144
00:09:57,220 --> 00:10:00,173
Ask Dong Bi! That's not important to me now.

145
00:10:00,173 --> 00:10:02,129
It is to me!
I feel so mad!

146
00:10:02,129 --> 00:10:04,849
I hate that you shared things
with her without me!

147
00:10:06,746 --> 00:10:08,676
You're so self-centered.

148
00:10:08,676 --> 00:10:11,903
I thought you're very
different from your mother.

149
00:10:12,844 --> 00:10:14,689
But you're a lot like her.

150
00:10:14,689 --> 00:10:16,369
Are you insulting my Mom right now?

151
00:10:16,369 --> 00:10:18,858
What's so bad about looking after yourself?

152
00:10:18,858 --> 00:10:21,481
All people tend to care about
themselves not others.

153
00:10:21,918 --> 00:10:23,997
Are you looking down on my mom because
she works in a store?

154
00:10:24,592 --> 00:10:30,079
I'm sure your mom lived well
in her little bubble...

155
00:10:30,148 --> 00:10:32,022
But my mom is different.

156
00:10:32,142 --> 00:10:36,621
My mom protected me by blocking
out the bad things in the world.

157
00:10:36,621 --> 00:10:38,411
That's why she's tough.

158
00:10:38,411 --> 00:10:41,382
Is that a bad thing?

159
00:10:41,382 --> 00:10:44,580
She never fooled anyone when
she sold goods to others.

160
00:10:44,645 --> 00:10:48,038
She never preyed on others with greed.

161
00:10:48,410 --> 00:10:50,993
Loving one's kids too much is a crime?

162
00:10:54,397 --> 00:10:56,951
Why do you change the subject?

163
00:10:57,719 --> 00:10:59,944
We were talking about Jun Sang Jin.

164
00:11:02,305 --> 00:11:05,767
You lied to me.
You lied to me habitually.

165
00:11:07,177 --> 00:11:11,303
If you ignore my mom,
I'm never going to forgive you.

166
00:11:32,688 --> 00:11:35,616
Sis, am I dead?

167
00:11:35,616 --> 00:11:39,157
It sounds like you know me from a previous life.

168
00:11:39,697 --> 00:11:45,213
My memories of the previous life disappeared after I became the angel of death.

169
00:11:46,535 --> 00:11:50,685
I knew you'd become something even after you died.

170
00:11:52,532 --> 00:11:57,863
You can't go to heaven since you haven't experienced a man.

171
00:11:58,799 --> 00:12:00,443
What?

172
00:12:01,603 --> 00:12:04,726
It's a sin if someone doesn't love anybody.

173
00:12:05,205 --> 00:12:07,655
You're one of them.

174
00:12:07,655 --> 00:12:10,140
Then what's going to happen to me?

175
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:13,338
You will have to wander in hell forever.

176
00:12:13,338 --> 00:12:15,975
No!

177
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:30,130
Your sister sleeps at late night, doesn't she?

178
00:12:33,967 --> 00:12:36,652
The light is still on!

179
00:12:37,163 --> 00:12:39,570
What were you thinking about?

180
00:12:40,535 --> 00:12:41,826
What's wrong?

181
00:12:42,728 --> 00:12:45,772
- Can I still hold your hand?
- Yeah, you can.

182
00:12:49,546 --> 00:12:51,681
Do you feel better if you play hard to get?

183
00:12:51,681 --> 00:12:54,239
- I'm not going to go home tonight.
- What are you talking about?

184
00:12:54,239 --> 00:12:55,947
I told you we should start from holding hands.

185
00:12:55,947 --> 00:12:57,541
Then when are we going to have sex?

186
00:12:57,541 --> 00:12:59,591
- What?
- Are we not sleeping together?

187
00:12:59,591 --> 00:13:02,586
We will.
Why rush?

188
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:07,746
We don't know when we're going to die.
We should do it and be done with it.

189
00:13:07,746 --> 00:13:10,410
What? Do what and get what done?

190
00:13:10,956 --> 00:13:13,163
Did you really not sleep with a man before?

191
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:17,369
I did.
I have.

192
00:13:17,369 --> 00:13:21,760
I can know if you're telling the truth or not.
A man can find out if it's the first time or not.

193
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:24,757
What should I do?
Should I tell him the truth?

194
00:13:24,757 --> 00:13:28,164
I like how my heart flutters
before I sleep with somebody.

195
00:13:28,164 --> 00:13:31,557
It's a very precious moment.
We can't just let it go away.

196
00:13:31,557 --> 00:13:34,725
Let's enjoy everything step by step.

197
00:13:34,725 --> 00:13:37,625
No! Holding hands isn't fun.

198
00:13:37,625 --> 00:13:41,954
- Just go home
- No!

199
00:13:44,346 --> 00:13:46,480
What are you doing?

200
00:13:47,472 --> 00:13:49,295
I'm not going to go!

201
00:13:49,295 --> 00:13:52,141
Just get punished by your sister.
I thinks that's a better idea.

202
00:13:52,141 --> 00:13:56,677
- Don't try to seduce me.
- You hate me after I held your hand, right?

203
00:13:59,053 --> 00:14:01,628
Hae Yoon.

204
00:14:01,798 --> 00:14:04,156
- Hae Yoon.
- What are you doing there?

205
00:14:04,156 --> 00:14:05,923
I'm going home.

206
00:14:07,853 --> 00:14:11,979
- Did you meet Jung Hoon?
- Yeah. Bye.

207
00:14:16,556 --> 00:14:20,041
What's wrong with her?
That was so cold.

208
00:14:20,922 --> 00:14:24,523
- Don't make Mom angry.
- What did I do?

209
00:14:25,267 --> 00:14:27,363
She's so stressed because of Hae Jin's divorce.

210
00:14:27,363 --> 00:14:29,350
Don't make her stressed.

211
00:14:29,350 --> 00:14:31,192
Hae Jin is getting a divorce?
Why?

212
00:14:31,192 --> 00:14:33,302
Are you really our family?

213
00:14:33,302 --> 00:14:35,633
- Sis.
- Kneel down.

214
00:14:35,995 --> 00:14:38,136
Hae Yoon is here.

215
00:14:38,136 --> 00:14:41,003
You know it's embarrassing.
You crazy bitch.

216
00:14:41,003 --> 00:14:44,961
Why do you date a thug? How can you trust a man who rides a motorcycle?

217
00:14:44,961 --> 00:14:46,424
He might die from riding that.

218
00:14:46,424 --> 00:14:51,043
I don't care if he's in a gang or not.
The fact that I'm dating a man is important.

219
00:14:51,043 --> 00:14:54,421
They say late bloomers are hopeless, and I see that's what happened.

220
00:14:54,421 --> 00:14:56,513
So are you going to live with him?

221
00:14:56,513 --> 00:14:58,946
I might or not.

222
00:14:58,946 --> 00:15:00,802
I'm going to do whatever I want to.

223
00:15:00,802 --> 00:15:06,687
So stop cleaning up the mess your kids made. Meet a rich man and start over!

224
00:15:06,687 --> 00:15:10,368
You can't even get compliments even if you sacrificed for us.

225
00:15:10,368 --> 00:15:13,371
Did you took drugs or something?

226
00:15:13,371 --> 00:15:15,908
Do I take care of my kids and my sister just to get compliments?

227
00:15:15,908 --> 00:15:20,310
Just leave me alone. I'm 50. There aren't many days left until I die.

228
00:15:21,545 --> 00:15:25,326
So are you going to die from riding the motorcycle? Sell that thing, okay?

229
00:15:25,326 --> 00:15:26,767
- No!
- Then get out!

230
00:15:26,767 --> 00:15:27,767
I can't stand you riding that.

231
00:15:28,947 --> 00:15:32,605
I'm not afraid of dying.
I'm afraid of living!

232
00:15:32,605 --> 00:15:36,348
- Fine. I'll get out of this house.
- You're so out of your mind now.

233
00:15:37,548 --> 00:15:39,642
Open the door.
Open it!

234
00:15:41,538 --> 00:15:45,122
- What are you doing?
- You must be so tired.

235
00:15:46,430 --> 00:15:48,638
Living is tiring.

236
00:15:48,638 --> 00:15:53,116
Just let them live their lives. Why do you have to take on their burdens?

237
00:15:53,116 --> 00:15:58,642
Poor people like us should get together. All we have is ourselves.

238
00:16:00,545 --> 00:16:02,786
What did Jung Hoon say to you?

239
00:16:03,381 --> 00:16:06,475
He's very temperamental just like his mom.

240
00:16:06,475 --> 00:16:08,290
Why is a rich family being so cheap?

241
00:16:08,292 --> 00:16:11,894
Is marriage a business? If they have more money, they can spend more.

242
00:16:11,894 --> 00:16:15,191
You'll be his family anyway.
Why do they care about profit and loss?

243
00:16:17,050 --> 00:16:19,169
What are you doing?

244
00:16:19,169 --> 00:16:22,030
Let me hug you for a while.

245
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:28,440
Don't worry though. I'll meet your mother-in-law again and work it out.

246
00:16:30,697 --> 00:16:34,598
I said sorry after I talked back to you last time, didn't I?

247
00:16:34,598 --> 00:16:38,477
It's not that important in our relationship.

248
00:16:56,876 --> 00:17:01,050
I thought you were different from your mother.

249
00:17:01,050 --> 00:17:03,762
But you're a lot like her.

250
00:17:11,496 --> 00:17:16,676
Does she think a marriage is like a business
since she's doing the business?

251
00:17:16,676 --> 00:17:19,467
Does she want to make a profit out of your marriage?

252
00:17:19,467 --> 00:17:25,005
We had a fight every single day while preparing for the wedding.

253
00:17:25,005 --> 00:17:28,909
I probably could endure it today, but not tomorrow

254
00:17:28,909 --> 00:17:32,578
I can't take a road when I know what's going to happen.

255
00:17:34,979 --> 00:17:38,626
You lied to me. You lied to me habitually.

256
00:17:52,146 --> 00:17:54,881
You got back. I knew you'd come back by now.

257
00:17:54,881 --> 00:17:58,490
I told you my password. You could've just come in. Why did you ring a bell?

258
00:17:58,490 --> 00:18:01,397
This is a woman's house. I can't just barge in.

259
00:18:02,853 --> 00:18:04,317
What are you doing?

260
00:18:04,827 --> 00:18:07,719
- I need a dog.
- Why?

261
00:18:08,247 --> 00:18:13,968
I saw in a movie that a Eskimo hugs
a dog when they sleep during cold days.

262
00:18:13,968 --> 00:18:16,254
I'm so cold tonight.

263
00:18:18,353 --> 00:18:19,977
How did your brother's funeral go?

264
00:18:19,977 --> 00:18:23,073
Are you going to be a dog or not?

265
00:18:23,073 --> 00:18:25,668
I can't be a dog unless I drink.

266
00:18:25,668 --> 00:18:31,661
Do you know how radiant my brother was?

267
00:18:33,372 --> 00:18:39,862
We were born from the same parents, but we were so different.

268
00:18:39,862 --> 00:18:43,831
I was jealous of him the most.

269
00:18:43,831 --> 00:18:47,496
But why did he die?

270
00:18:47,496 --> 00:18:50,298
How much did Hae Yoon and Sang Jin love each other?

271
00:18:51,385 --> 00:18:56,817
Oh my God. How can I lock up Mrs. Jung's mouth?

272
00:18:56,817 --> 00:18:59,569
What a bad bastard!
You're so selfish!

273
00:18:59,569 --> 00:19:03,585
Your suffering comes first before mine even at this moment.

274
00:19:03,585 --> 00:19:06,139
I have nothing to say though.

275
00:19:06,139 --> 00:19:09,776
At this moment, nothing will make you feel better.

276
00:19:11,103 --> 00:19:20,403
If there's only one person that understands
you, you will never give up hope.

277
00:19:20,403 --> 00:19:25,211
He had everything but why? Why?

278
00:19:25,596 --> 00:19:28,356
Why didn't he have that one person?

279
00:19:31,825 --> 00:19:34,046
There's this famous saying in China.

280
00:19:34,046 --> 00:19:39,314
A man risks his life for a woman who acknowledges him.

281
00:19:39,314 --> 00:19:42,554
A woman risks her life for a man who loves her.

282
00:19:42,554 --> 00:19:50,055
You're so stupid. A woman puts make
up on for a man who loves her.

283
00:19:50,055 --> 00:19:52,235
It was make up?

284
00:19:52,235 --> 00:19:57,835
So a woman doesn't risk her life?
Anyway, my point is

285
00:19:57,835 --> 00:20:03,406
it's hard to earn someone's heart.

286
00:20:04,787 --> 00:20:08,668
A man will risk his life if a woman acknowledges him.

287
00:20:09,521 --> 00:20:14,636
I had a chance to be that person.

288
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:20,786
I had a chance!
I did have a chance on that day!

289
00:20:20,786 --> 00:20:23,144
Let's not pull out my hair.

290
00:20:26,778 --> 00:20:29,493
You're so mean.

291
00:20:29,493 --> 00:20:35,474
Don't risk your life, you bastard!

292
00:20:35,474 --> 00:20:39,801
Don't do that.

293
00:21:30,407 --> 00:21:32,323
Daddy.
Daddy.

294
00:21:39,494 --> 00:21:41,704
Daddy!

295
00:22:20,077 --> 00:22:23,210
I'll go there soon. I know. I'll be there soon.

296
00:22:23,210 --> 00:22:28,403
Just send the patients to Dr. Yoon.

297
00:22:28,403 --> 00:22:31,170
I'll do the surgery after I get there.
Be prepared.

298
00:22:32,833 --> 00:22:36,197
- Do you have to go back to the hospital?
- Yeah.

299
00:22:36,197 --> 00:22:41,054
I had so much fun. It was my
first time coming here with you.

300
00:22:41,054 --> 00:22:44,117
Isn't it, Mom?

301
00:22:44,117 --> 00:22:49,443
- We came here together before.
- Yeah, we did.

302
00:22:51,801 --> 00:22:55,924
The reason why Mom and Dad came here with you is because we have something to tell you.

303
00:22:55,924 --> 00:22:59,253
Honey, let's not start this way.

304
00:22:59,253 --> 00:23:02,499
He's seven. He's exposed to TV and games.

305
00:23:02,499 --> 00:23:04,876
Let's not make him confused.

306
00:23:04,876 --> 00:23:08,619
Maybe what I was worried about is happening.

307
00:23:09,276 --> 00:23:11,119
What did you worry about?

308
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:18,108
Are you going to die, Dad?
No wonder you were being nice to me.

309
00:23:18,708 --> 00:23:22,231
No. He's not going to die, Tae Hyun.

310
00:23:22,231 --> 00:23:25,525
- It's okay. Don't cry.
- You're lying.

311
00:23:25,525 --> 00:23:30,348
It felt strange that you were being nice to me recently.

312
00:23:58,192 --> 00:24:01,086
Give him to me. I'll do it.
You have to go to the hospital.

313
00:24:01,086 --> 00:24:03,633
Just go open the door.

314
00:25:01,646 --> 00:25:03,895
- It's your stuff.
- Did you pack them already?

315
00:25:03,895 --> 00:25:07,058
It was my job to pack your stuff
when you went to the seminar

316
00:25:07,058 --> 00:25:09,420
- It's not hard for me.
- Why are there two?

317
00:25:09,420 --> 00:25:13,164
These are winter clothes so I
also packed clothes for the spring.

318
00:25:13,164 --> 00:25:15,414
It's like you wanted me to leave a long time ago.

319
00:25:15,414 --> 00:25:18,365
This is what you want.

320
00:25:18,365 --> 00:25:20,846
Go now.

321
00:25:20,846 --> 00:25:24,000
We didn't tell Tae Hyun that
we're getting a divorce.

322
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:27,405
I will do it. You saw how he reacted to it.

323
00:25:27,405 --> 00:25:30,328
You weren't home a lot.
He wouldn't even notice you left.

324
00:25:30,994 --> 00:25:34,252
- You can see him on weekends.
- Which one is the winter clothes?

325
00:25:34,252 --> 00:25:36,442
This one.

326
00:25:37,333 --> 00:25:40,096
I will only take this with me.

327
00:25:49,227 --> 00:25:52,140
- What is this?
- Let me stay here for a while.

328
00:25:53,293 --> 00:25:56,280
Hey, hey.

329
00:26:00,077 --> 00:26:02,254
If there's a can beer, give me one.

330
00:26:02,254 --> 00:26:04,195
Wasn't yesterday the trial?

331
00:26:04,195 --> 00:26:07,124
Yeah. So I feel nasty now.

332
00:26:07,890 --> 00:26:09,726
I told you to get a divorce by agreement.

333
00:26:09,726 --> 00:26:11,963
Even that makes you feel nasty.

334
00:26:14,151 --> 00:26:16,259
Here.

335
00:26:18,133 --> 00:26:23,404
After the first trial with my first ex-wife,
she started to cry at the stairs.

336
00:26:23,404 --> 00:26:25,128
She was the one who
wanted the divorce.

337
00:26:25,128 --> 00:26:27,435
I wanted to cry but I tried not to.

338
00:26:29,499 --> 00:26:32,451
I thought I'd feel less sad
with my second ex-wife.

339
00:26:32,451 --> 00:26:38,149
But I felt exactly the same.
You can't get used to pain.

340
00:26:38,216 --> 00:26:40,766
I miss my father.

341
00:26:40,766 --> 00:26:44,290
He was a very strict person.

342
00:26:44,290 --> 00:26:47,293
He was very busy studying every day.

343
00:26:47,293 --> 00:26:52,784
If he had a free day, my mom didn't let me
play with him because he was tired.

344
00:26:54,447 --> 00:26:56,311
Did you tell your parents about the divorce?

345
00:26:56,311 --> 00:27:00,320
Not yet. I'm planning to go there next week.

346
00:27:01,780 --> 00:27:04,500
I'm wondering how my father will react.

347
00:27:04,500 --> 00:27:08,327
He didn't like this marriage anyway
so he'll probably be happy.

348
00:27:09,350 --> 00:27:12,346
There's no possibility that Hae
Jin and you will get back together?

349
00:27:13,358 --> 00:27:16,432
I think I'm done with her.

350
00:27:16,432 --> 00:27:20,881
She looked like one of plaintiffs
for my malpractice suit.

351
00:27:33,548 --> 00:27:36,100
- What's this?
- Let me stay here for a while.

352
00:27:36,100 --> 00:27:41,092
- No.
- Why not? She almost killed me last night.

353
00:27:41,092 --> 00:27:45,277
Let me just stay here for a while. She's very
stressed because of her daughter's divorce.

354
00:27:46,138 --> 00:27:49,715
- Hi.
- Hey.

355
00:27:49,715 --> 00:27:53,897
Then have fun but don't stay.
I came first.

356
00:27:54,688 --> 00:27:59,248
Wow. I thought my sister was
going too far with the divorce.

357
00:27:59,248 --> 00:28:01,047
Think whatever you want.

358
00:28:01,047 --> 00:28:04,243
I suppose Mrs. Jung and I are the first
ones who found out about this.

359
00:28:04,243 --> 00:28:06,521
Fights aren't allowed in this house.

360
00:28:06,521 --> 00:28:09,597
I should go to my hospital now.
See you later, Min Ho.

361
00:28:09,597 --> 00:28:10,880
Sure.

362
00:28:10,880 --> 00:28:13,737
- You're going to eat dinner outside, right?
- Yeah.

363
00:28:15,346 --> 00:28:17,735
- Is it me or him?
- What?

364
00:28:17,735 --> 00:28:20,435
Who gets to stay here? Me or him?

365
00:28:20,435 --> 00:28:21,641
You both can stay here.

366
00:28:21,641 --> 00:28:23,979
How can I do that?
Is it me or that bastard?

367
00:28:27,573 --> 00:28:29,245
Let's break up.

368
00:28:29,245 --> 00:28:32,050
It hasn't been 24 hours
since we started dating.

369
00:28:32,050 --> 00:28:34,161
I know. This was the shortest
relationship that I had.

370
00:28:34,968 --> 00:28:37,808
I've forgotten what it was
like to date a woman.

371
00:28:37,808 --> 00:28:41,439
And you're one of them. I hate
being forced to make a choice.

372
00:28:41,439 --> 00:28:43,120
Can we not all live together?

373
00:28:43,554 --> 00:28:44,858
Why did you slap me?

374
00:28:44,858 --> 00:28:47,628
Don't tell me that kind of stuff so easily.

375
00:28:47,628 --> 00:28:51,217
What's this?
Am I dating a clingy woman?

376
00:28:53,691 --> 00:28:57,342
I think I fell in love with you
the moment I held your hand.

377
00:28:58,536 --> 00:29:02,109
I won't force to make you a choice.
Do you still want to break up with me?

378
00:29:04,771 --> 00:29:07,450
We did the holding hands step.
Next step is to kiss.

379
00:29:07,450 --> 00:29:09,266
We did kiss.

380
00:29:09,266 --> 00:29:11,906
That one doesn't count because
it was before we started dating.

381
00:29:11,906 --> 00:29:16,452
You're so funny.

382
00:29:25,149 --> 00:29:27,770
My head hurts because of the hangover.

383
00:29:29,993 --> 00:29:34,204
- Are you not taking shower?
- I don't shower in the morning.

384
00:29:34,569 --> 00:29:37,305
Do you plan to remain a virgin
until marriage or something?

385
00:29:37,305 --> 00:29:39,846
It's the first time I didn't sleep
with a woman in a hotel.

386
00:29:39,846 --> 00:29:42,367
I guess you come to hotels with women often.

387
00:29:42,367 --> 00:29:44,804
It isn't the first time for you either.

388
00:29:45,798 --> 00:29:47,120
Did you check my background?

389
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:49,207
Don't you know how small this circle is?

390
00:29:49,207 --> 00:29:54,043
You dated so many men. I didn't want
to know but my friends told me that.

391
00:29:55,748 --> 00:30:00,119
I'm not planning to remain a virgin until
marriage but I won't sleep with you.

392
00:30:00,119 --> 00:30:02,755
I'm going to change my clothes.
Order some food for me.

393
00:30:02,755 --> 00:30:05,336
Can we still order food in this time?

394
00:30:05,336 --> 00:30:07,817
We can. I came here with
somebody this time.

395
00:30:07,817 --> 00:30:10,061
I want a steak.

396
00:30:12,571 --> 00:30:16,570
I don't love you either but
I have sense of kinship.

397
00:30:16,570 --> 00:30:20,127
We both know this is
a marriage of convenience.

398
00:30:20,495 --> 00:30:23,543
To maintain this marriage,
we should respect each other.

399
00:30:23,543 --> 00:30:26,051
Coming to a hotel with women
is respecting me?

400
00:30:26,051 --> 00:30:29,228
It's like you're hiding something.

401
00:30:29,836 --> 00:30:31,870
I thought you'd tell me if I did first.

402
00:30:31,870 --> 00:30:34,483
This is a marriage where we don't
have to share our secrets.

403
00:30:34,483 --> 00:30:39,414
I don't want to know your secret.
I want to know what you're hiding.

404
00:30:39,414 --> 00:30:42,037
Do you think only your friends
tell you about my past?

405
00:30:42,037 --> 00:30:44,175
They tell me about your past too.

406
00:30:44,175 --> 00:30:46,283
Don't you know how small this circle is?

407
00:30:48,213 --> 00:30:52,011
If this is going to bother our
marriage, let's not do this marriage.

408
00:30:52,011 --> 00:30:54,861
I'll tell my parents.

409
00:30:54,861 --> 00:30:59,436
I think you're feeling got hurt. I guess
you're not a real business man.

410
00:30:59,436 --> 00:31:01,323
You said marriage is a business.

411
00:31:01,323 --> 00:31:04,249
You're calling off the marriage because of your assumption.

412
00:31:04,249 --> 00:31:10,319
Sometimes, assumption can be more accurate than evidence.

413
00:31:11,425 --> 00:31:17,910
Okay, I'll behave. I'd rather be a divorcee than break off an engagement.

414
00:31:19,833 --> 00:31:22,424
Are you going to order me the steak?

415
00:31:24,008 --> 00:31:25,559
What the hell are you?

416
00:31:25,559 --> 00:31:29,547
There's only one goal for this marriage.
I want to be free from my family.

417
00:31:30,178 --> 00:31:33,772
You also get help from your father
if you do this marriage.

418
00:31:33,772 --> 00:31:37,179
It's win-win for us, is it not?

419
00:31:37,188 --> 00:31:40,612
You order the food.
I'm going to take a shower.

420
00:31:40,612 --> 00:31:43,602
Don't speak to me informally.
Let's follow the rule.

421
00:31:44,414 --> 00:31:49,308
Sure. Could you order
food yourself please?

422
00:32:14,842 --> 00:32:17,003
- Hey.
- Where are you?

423
00:32:18,087 --> 00:32:20,580
- I'm still in a hotel.
- Can you not talk?

424
00:32:21,817 --> 00:32:24,615
- Yes, I can. What is it?
- Dong Bi got back so don't worry.

425
00:32:24,615 --> 00:32:26,785
Can you tell her that I'm worried about her?

426
00:32:26,785 --> 00:32:30,351
No, I didn't. I didn't want her to suffer because of you.

427
00:32:31,278 --> 00:32:38,074
What was her problem anyway?
Well, everyone thinks differently.

428
00:32:38,074 --> 00:32:39,977
- Jung Hoon.
- My mom's here.

429
00:32:39,977 --> 00:32:41,271
Why is she there?

430
00:32:41,271 --> 00:32:44,227
I couldn't go home because
I slept at Dong Bi's house.

431
00:32:44,871 --> 00:32:47,279
Okay.
Bye.

432
00:32:51,212 --> 00:32:54,922
Even in business, you can have feelings.

433
00:32:55,875 --> 00:32:58,633
I learned a lesson.

434
00:32:58,633 --> 00:33:01,833
I think you have a bad habit.
Why do you sleep out?

435
00:33:01,833 --> 00:33:04,847
Even if you're going to get
married, this isn't good.

436
00:33:04,847 --> 00:33:07,574
You're guessing wrong.
I was at Dong Bi's house.

437
00:33:07,574 --> 00:33:09,533
She was having a hard time
because of her family.

438
00:33:09,533 --> 00:33:14,320
But still, you guys are a man and a woman.
Hae Yoon must be so happy to hear that.

439
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:16,325
Dong Bi is like my brother.
Hae Yoon understands that.

440
00:33:16,325 --> 00:33:20,198
No, she doesn't.
You don't know about women.

441
00:33:20,198 --> 00:33:23,873
Don't let her know. Even if Dong Bi is a
friend, I'd be upset.

442
00:33:23,873 --> 00:33:29,268
You always butt your nose in my business.
And don't make things like this. It's tiring for you.

443
00:33:29,268 --> 00:33:32,354
I had to go somewhere anyway.
I'm going to meet Hae Yoon's mom.

444
00:33:32,354 --> 00:33:35,035
We're going to visit
the home we're getting you.

445
00:33:35,650 --> 00:33:41,541
Did you say something bad about her
business when you were yelling at Hae Yoon?

446
00:33:41,541 --> 00:33:43,932
Did she tell you about that already?

447
00:33:43,932 --> 00:33:45,915
You did.
Okay.

448
00:33:45,915 --> 00:33:49,043
Is that it? What did she say about that?

449
00:33:49,043 --> 00:33:50,850
Hae Yoon didn't say anything.
Calm down.

450
00:33:50,850 --> 00:33:53,047
You get mad whenever I say something.

451
00:33:53,047 --> 00:33:54,158
Am I doing it for no reason?

452
00:33:54,158 --> 00:33:57,528
I know there's reason. That's
why I'm not saying anything.

453
00:33:59,341 --> 00:34:01,337
About the house...

454
00:34:01,337 --> 00:34:05,742
The bride's side doesn't have to pay
for the interior design, right?

455
00:34:05,742 --> 00:34:08,651
We're going to have to pay for that anyway.

456
00:34:08,651 --> 00:34:10,954
I'm going to see if she's
mooching off me again.

457
00:34:12,061 --> 00:34:15,413
I'll decide if I can trust you
or not after you solve this problem.

458
00:34:15,413 --> 00:34:17,875
Why are you not saying anything?
Are you mad?

459
00:34:19,384 --> 00:34:20,932
No.

460
00:34:29,199 --> 00:34:30,678
You don't have to see me out.

461
00:34:30,678 --> 00:34:34,603
- What are you thinking?
- Nothing.

462
00:34:34,603 --> 00:34:38,944
If you ignore my mom, I'm never
going to forgive you.

463
00:34:40,532 --> 00:34:43,489
You're lying.
You're thinking about something else.

464
00:34:45,889 --> 00:34:48,103
What are you doing?
Hey?

465
00:34:48,103 --> 00:34:50,916
Where are you going?

466
00:34:50,916 --> 00:34:53,352
What's wrong?

467
00:34:55,451 --> 00:34:58,670
- Please just kill me.
- Why? What's wrong?

468
00:34:58,670 --> 00:35:00,921
You can call me stupid or something.

469
00:35:00,921 --> 00:35:03,400
I can't live without Hae Yoon.
I can't see her getting hurt.

470
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:06,431
I can't stand that it's me
who hurts her feelings.

471
00:35:06,431 --> 00:35:10,646
I know Mrs. Jung is rude, but you
don't have to be rude to her.

472
00:35:10,646 --> 00:35:12,850
I can't believe you're doing this.

473
00:35:12,850 --> 00:35:15,682
We can pay everything. Let's do that.
We have enough money.

474
00:35:15,682 --> 00:35:19,914
What's wrong with paying everything.
We have enough.

475
00:35:19,914 --> 00:35:24,713
Why did I give birth to you?
If I can, I want to turn back time.

476
00:35:24,713 --> 00:35:26,295
You're a nice woman.

477
00:35:26,342 --> 00:35:28,265
You don't judge people by money.

478
00:35:28,265 --> 00:35:31,396
This is your work place. Get up.
What if people see you?

479
00:35:31,396 --> 00:35:34,261
So I came to the corner.
Please, save my life.

480
00:35:34,261 --> 00:35:37,767
Don't pick up the fight with Hae Yoon's mom.
Just do whatever she wants.

481
00:35:37,767 --> 00:35:40,726
This is why she thinks you're so easy.

482
00:35:44,024 --> 00:35:45,723
I'm counting on you.

483
00:36:06,487 --> 00:36:09,137
You came at the appointed hour.

484
00:36:09,137 --> 00:36:12,505
One's credit is very important
to people who do business.

485
00:36:12,505 --> 00:36:15,508
I hate the way she talks.

486
00:36:15,508 --> 00:36:19,691
I hope Hae Yoon didn't tell her about what I said to her.

487
00:36:19,691 --> 00:36:21,692
Which floor is it?

488
00:36:29,573 --> 00:36:32,933
People who lived here before didn't
take care of the house very well.

489
00:36:32,933 --> 00:36:35,069
Now we agree on something.

490
00:36:35,069 --> 00:36:36,134
I know.

491
00:36:36,134 --> 00:36:38,383
How long has this apartment been around?

492
00:36:38,383 --> 00:36:40,160
About ten years.

493
00:36:40,160 --> 00:36:47,696
It has been long. What if the price goes
down, and they have to live here forever?

494
00:36:47,696 --> 00:36:49,972
I knew she would say that.

495
00:36:49,972 --> 00:36:53,277
Just because it's a new apartment,
doesn't mean everything is good.

496
00:36:53,277 --> 00:36:57,088
The price depends on the location
and the condition of the house.

497
00:36:57,088 --> 00:37:01,622
I think this one is okay. There might be a
sick house syndrome for a new apartment.

498
00:37:01,622 --> 00:37:05,035
I heard there isn't sick house syndrome
if it's made in eco friendly materials.

499
00:37:05,035 --> 00:37:07,393
You sure know about a lot of stuff.

500
00:37:07,393 --> 00:37:10,188
That's why I could make a living without starving myself.

501
00:37:10,655 --> 00:37:13,567
But not as much as you do.

502
00:37:13,567 --> 00:37:17,946
I never heard of setting up
a budget for the marriage this way.

503
00:37:17,946 --> 00:37:22,094
That was an idea I made up. It's obvious
that you never heard about it.

504
00:37:22,094 --> 00:37:25,566
Would I think of this if it weren't that bad?

505
00:37:31,814 --> 00:37:33,947
I think we will have to change the toilet too.

506
00:37:33,947 --> 00:37:36,828
- We should fix everything, right?
- Yes.

507
00:37:36,828 --> 00:37:39,528
We will have to make an estimate.

508
00:37:39,528 --> 00:37:45,545
If they plan on having children, the interior shouldn't give off the aura of newlyweds.

509
00:37:45,545 --> 00:37:47,139
I don't know how many babies they're having.

510
00:37:47,139 --> 00:37:51,316
The baby might ruin the design anyway,
so don't spent too much money on interior design.

511
00:37:51,316 --> 00:37:53,281
Do we have to pay for that again?
I should counterattack.

512
00:37:53,281 --> 00:37:56,668
If you're done with the design, I'll buy furniture.

513
00:37:57,159 --> 00:38:01,952
I feel so bad for making you pay all that.
So I'll buy furniture.

514
00:38:01,952 --> 00:38:04,097
So you're only preparing the bottom drawer?

515
00:38:04,097 --> 00:38:07,560
Mrs. Ha, humans are born,
and then the money comes.

516
00:38:07,560 --> 00:38:10,431
If you care too much about money,
you'll miss the people around you.

517
00:38:10,787 --> 00:38:15,158
It's like you're a real business woman.
You're good at calculating profit and loss.

518
00:38:15,158 --> 00:38:17,096
Oh my God.
That's what I want to say.

519
00:38:17,096 --> 00:38:20,630
You're so much better at calculating the profit and loss.

520
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:24,474
Before I came to see you, my son
said we should pay everything.

521
00:38:24,474 --> 00:38:26,450
Because we have enough money.

522
00:38:26,450 --> 00:38:28,109
Then listen to him.

523
00:38:28,109 --> 00:38:34,668
I think he was right about that.
Love is what's most important.

524
00:38:34,668 --> 00:38:38,149
If you want to show off yourself, do it. It's not that hard to listen.

525
00:38:39,203 --> 00:38:41,583
I must've misunderstood.

526
00:38:41,583 --> 00:38:47,322
I know you're not a materialistic person.
You don't judge people by money.

527
00:38:48,004 --> 00:38:49,692
Of course I don't.

528
00:38:49,692 --> 00:38:53,231
Since we're done discussing, let's go home.

529
00:38:53,231 --> 00:38:55,447
Something went wrong.

530
00:38:55,447 --> 00:38:58,682
- How are you going to go home?
- I can take a taxi.

531
00:38:58,682 --> 00:39:02,933
I'll take you home. The gas
price is so high these days.

532
00:39:02,933 --> 00:39:04,779
She's making a favor of it.

533
00:39:04,779 --> 00:39:07,160
It's okay. I can take a taxi.

534
00:39:07,780 --> 00:39:09,870
Why don't you drive?

535
00:39:10,374 --> 00:39:12,944
I have a husband and son who can give
me a ride. Or I can take a taxi.

536
00:39:13,490 --> 00:39:16,499
Even if they're your families, you
shouldn't rely on them too much.

537
00:39:16,499 --> 00:39:19,957
They might get tired of it.
They're not your servants.

538
00:39:19,957 --> 00:39:21,037
She's trying to teach me again.

539
00:39:21,037 --> 00:39:25,336
The men in my life love to serve me.

540
00:39:25,336 --> 00:39:26,803
Believe what want to believe.

541
00:39:27,508 --> 00:39:29,482
Pardon?

542
00:39:30,887 --> 00:39:33,639
You know what's good
after I lost my husband?

543
00:39:33,639 --> 00:39:36,739
There is a good thing after
you lost your husband?

544
00:39:36,739 --> 00:39:41,825
There's nothing to be afraid of.
To feed my kid, I can do anything.

545
00:39:42,186 --> 00:39:45,401
There's nothing I can't take on.

546
00:39:46,058 --> 00:39:50,426
That's why you're brazen. You need to have a sense of honor though.

547
00:39:52,803 --> 00:39:55,091
What the heck?

548
00:39:57,274 --> 00:40:00,482
- It's okay.
- No. They should learn a lesson.

549
00:40:00,482 --> 00:40:02,461
That crazy bastard.

550
00:40:05,279 --> 00:40:09,508
Hey, you bastard! Where did you
learn how to drive? You suck at it!

551
00:40:09,508 --> 00:40:14,759
Are you laughing at me now?
You stop the car right now!

552
00:40:30,866 --> 00:40:33,848
- I'll not get off.
- Sure. Bye.

553
00:40:33,848 --> 00:40:35,618
Bye.

554
00:40:45,163 --> 00:40:46,817
I can't beat her.

555
00:40:46,817 --> 00:40:51,403
You said you're going to beat her up
this time. It didn't go well?

556
00:40:51,403 --> 00:40:55,943
She drives so recklessly. I almost died.

557
00:40:55,943 --> 00:41:00,804
I feel like it was some kind of warning
to be nice to her daughter or something.

558
00:41:00,804 --> 00:41:05,122
She looks nice but she is pretty tough.

559
00:41:05,122 --> 00:41:07,953
I'm going to beat her one day.

560
00:41:08,548 --> 00:41:09,606
How?

561
00:41:09,606 --> 00:41:13,725
I can't beat her physically but
I'm going to beat her verbally.

562
00:41:14,446 --> 00:41:16,233
Is she that good of a speaker?

563
00:41:16,233 --> 00:41:20,166
Yes, she is. She told me that humans
are born, and then comes the money.

564
00:41:20,166 --> 00:41:25,532
That's what I should've said to her.
Why didn't I say that before?

565
00:41:25,532 --> 00:41:29,277
My counterattack was good,
but the finish wasn't that good.

566
00:41:29,277 --> 00:41:32,733
I tried to comfort myself by
thinking of Jung Hoon but I can't.

567
00:41:32,979 --> 00:41:34,541
What did Jung Hoon say?

568
00:41:34,541 --> 00:41:39,493
He told me to pay everything and
not to hurt Hae Yoon's feeling.

569
00:41:40,141 --> 00:41:43,076
He said that because he has
to take responsibility.

570
00:41:43,076 --> 00:41:46,078
But he's incompetent. I feel bad for him.

571
00:41:46,078 --> 00:41:49,644
Please consider Hae Yoon's situation.

572
00:41:49,644 --> 00:41:51,185
How?

573
00:41:51,185 --> 00:41:54,383
Usually groom's parents should pay more.

574
00:41:54,383 --> 00:41:58,761
Let's stop talking about it and find some
class so you can be a good speaker too.

575
00:41:58,761 --> 00:42:03,729
- Let's win!
- I'm going to!

576
00:42:12,903 --> 00:42:16,332
Your mother has given up.
Love Hae Yoon as much as you want.

577
00:42:24,376 --> 00:42:27,500
I have something to say to you.
I'll meet you at your building.

578
00:42:43,125 --> 00:42:46,006
Thank you for calling me first.
There is a lot to talk about.

579
00:42:46,006 --> 00:42:48,333
Let's talk calmly.

580
00:43:20,328 --> 00:43:22,222
Give these to your mom.

581
00:43:23,158 --> 00:43:26,560
Mom doesn't need anything.
Don't buy stuff for her.

582
00:43:33,740 --> 00:43:35,767
It's what my mom gave you.

583
00:43:35,767 --> 00:43:39,970
I should give these to her, but
I'm not brave enough to see her.

584
00:43:43,966 --> 00:43:45,661
What do you mean?

585
00:43:48,411 --> 00:43:50,563
I want to break up with you.

586
00:43:54,505 --> 00:43:56,200
It's not only you having a hard time.

587
00:43:56,200 --> 00:44:04,238
Giving up like this makes all the
things we went through come to nothing.

588
00:44:05,840 --> 00:44:08,841
- Did you know it snowed yesterday?
- Really?

589
00:44:09,976 --> 00:44:12,163
It was the first snow of the year.

590
00:44:12,163 --> 00:44:15,982
The first snow after we started
dating was like this too.

591
00:44:16,438 --> 00:44:18,720
What do we do if we meet up these days?

592
00:44:18,720 --> 00:44:23,500
We talked about what our mom
said about the wedding.

593
00:44:23,500 --> 00:44:28,049
The most important thing for love is romance,
but that's gone.

594
00:44:28,402 --> 00:44:31,447
There's only petty reality left.

595
00:44:32,445 --> 00:44:35,051
This is the first reason
why we should break up.

596
00:44:38,518 --> 00:44:40,965
The second reason is...

597
00:44:41,809 --> 00:44:44,012
The second one is more
important than the first one.

598
00:44:45,532 --> 00:44:53,496
All the insecurities that I've tried
to hide have started to come out.

599
00:44:53,496 --> 00:44:55,036
Why am I not from a rich family?

600
00:44:56,345 --> 00:44:58,913
Why isn't my mom elegant?

601
00:44:59,522 --> 00:45:03,498
Why did my dad pass away so fast?

602
00:45:05,758 --> 00:45:07,783
It gets worse if I see your parents.

603
00:45:07,783 --> 00:45:09,549
I'm so jealous that your
parents get along well.

604
00:45:09,549 --> 00:45:16,120
And I'm jealous of your mother's self-confidence.

605
00:45:16,120 --> 00:45:19,259
I'm jealous of you because
they are your parents.

606
00:45:20,204 --> 00:45:23,340
And I keep fighting with myself.

607
00:45:23,340 --> 00:45:27,254
Saying, 'Jung Hae Yoon,
you're a great person.'

608
00:45:28,269 --> 00:45:36,895
In that way, I try to assert my confidence.

609
00:45:36,895 --> 00:45:38,495
I have to try.

610
00:45:38,742 --> 00:45:47,658
I tell myself that I'm a worthy woman
because I have control over you.

611
00:45:54,153 --> 00:45:56,814
Our love surrendered to reality.

612
00:45:56,814 --> 00:46:01,990
Our love is making us weak, not strong.

613
00:46:02,025 --> 00:46:07,116
I'm sorry that I pushed you to marry me.

614
00:46:11,055 --> 00:46:13,462
You did push me, but in the end,
the choice was mine.

615
00:46:13,462 --> 00:46:16,503
Don't be ridiculous. You're a great woman.
That's true.

616
00:46:16,505 --> 00:46:20,165
You're just blaming yourself because
you're in a state of confusion.

617
00:46:21,047 --> 00:46:23,622
I'll do better not to
make you think that way.

618
00:46:23,622 --> 00:46:26,994
The third reason is...

619
00:46:27,515 --> 00:46:31,056
This is the most important reason.

620
00:46:37,978 --> 00:46:40,138
I love you.

621
00:46:40,645 --> 00:46:43,630
If I think of you suffering because of me

622
00:46:43,630 --> 00:46:46,101
it pains my heart.

623
00:46:47,037 --> 00:46:54,026
I love you. I love you more than myself.
How can I see you getting hurt because of me?

624
00:46:54,843 --> 00:46:58,199
This is a good chance to run away from me.

625
00:47:00,972 --> 00:47:04,329
Don't do that. I'm a having hard time
being in the middle of all of this.

626
00:47:06,272 --> 00:47:10,791
If we get married, we probably don't
have time to see your mother.

627
00:47:10,791 --> 00:47:11,980
I need to see her.

628
00:47:11,980 --> 00:47:14,185
I have sympathy for my mom.

629
00:47:14,185 --> 00:47:16,755
Others might say bad things about her.

630
00:47:18,864 --> 00:47:21,032
But I saw her life.

631
00:47:21,032 --> 00:47:23,486
I saw what she went through.

632
00:47:25,001 --> 00:47:27,885
I can't ignore her.

633
00:47:31,542 --> 00:47:33,680
Okay. I'll be good to your mom.

634
00:47:35,759 --> 00:47:38,568
Didn't you hear what I said so far?

635
00:47:38,568 --> 00:47:41,620
I'm the problem not you.

636
00:47:53,046 --> 00:47:55,064
Are you sure you won't regret it?

637
00:47:57,693 --> 00:48:01,881
I'm not sure.

638
00:48:01,881 --> 00:48:04,651
But I'm not going to come back.

639
00:48:06,909 --> 00:48:08,813
Why are you crying then?

640
00:48:10,061 --> 00:48:13,148
I'm not crying.

641
00:48:20,025 --> 00:48:24,802
Okay. I won't cling to you anymore.

642
00:48:25,662 --> 00:48:31,591
You said what we are left with is
petty reality. How can I stop you?

643
00:49:13,059 --> 00:49:16,570
- She isn't home yet.
- The room will be sold soon, right?

644
00:49:16,570 --> 00:49:18,401
I should see it first.

645
00:49:20,541 --> 00:49:23,254
- Which room is it?
- It's this one.

646
00:49:26,813 --> 00:49:31,013
Sell it to a woman that'd only sleep here.
I don't want her to drink a lot.

647
00:49:33,631 --> 00:49:36,225
- Who is she?
- Don't bother.

648
00:49:36,225 --> 00:49:38,669
Okay.
I'll call you later then.

649
00:49:38,669 --> 00:49:41,492
Okay.

650
00:49:41,492 --> 00:49:43,999
- Bye.
- Bye.

651
00:49:43,999 --> 00:49:47,760
- What was that?
- I put your room for sale.

652
00:49:47,760 --> 00:49:49,838
Why did you do that?

653
00:49:49,838 --> 00:49:51,970
What did I say?

654
00:49:51,970 --> 00:49:53,327
I'm sorry, sis.

655
00:49:53,327 --> 00:49:57,501
I knew you'd come back. He felt burdened
when you wanted to move in?

656
00:49:57,501 --> 00:50:00,722
He looks so irresponsible!

657
00:50:02,565 --> 00:50:04,689
Your taste in men is so bad.

658
00:50:04,689 --> 00:50:07,557
- It's not that.
- Then what is it?

659
00:50:07,557 --> 00:50:10,232
Somebody was in his house before I came.

660
00:50:10,232 --> 00:50:12,826
- Is that a women?
- No, it was Do Hyun.

661
00:50:12,826 --> 00:50:15,629
- He was there?
- Yeah.

662
00:50:15,629 --> 00:50:17,986
How could I live there?

663
00:50:17,986 --> 00:50:20,409
Sis, I have pride.

664
00:50:20,990 --> 00:50:24,026
Make a choice. Are you going
to sell the motorcycle or not?

665
00:50:24,026 --> 00:50:25,897
Are you going to?

666
00:50:26,594 --> 00:50:28,023
This is how he felt.

667
00:50:28,023 --> 00:50:30,424
Do I have to choose?

668
00:50:30,424 --> 00:50:34,430
The third option is I convince
you to let me ride.

669
00:50:34,430 --> 00:50:37,054
Shut up.
Are you going to sell it or not?

670
00:50:37,054 --> 00:50:39,750
- I'll sell it.
- Are you going to date him or not?

671
00:50:39,750 --> 00:50:41,683
Are you going to date him or not?

672
00:50:41,683 --> 00:50:44,679
Do I really have to make a choice?
We can negotiate.

673
00:50:44,679 --> 00:50:46,750
- Then get out!
- I'll not date him.

674
00:50:53,979 --> 00:50:59,203
Your sister-in-law didn't
come for her skin care.

675
00:50:59,203 --> 00:51:01,107
Call her and tell her to come.

676
00:51:05,253 --> 00:51:07,627
He still cares about them even
if he's getting a divorce.

677
00:51:37,433 --> 00:51:41,643
Tae Hyun, why did you think
Dad was going to die?

678
00:51:41,643 --> 00:51:47,913
Grandma said if a person does something he
didn't before, then he's going to die soon.

679
00:51:49,887 --> 00:51:52,592
I was so nervous because of him.

680
00:51:53,142 --> 00:51:56,502
He's not going to die. He's very healthy.

681
00:51:56,502 --> 00:52:01,816
He's going to protect you
until you're grown up.

682
00:52:16,050 --> 00:52:17,767
- Tae Hyun.
- Yes?

683
00:52:17,767 --> 00:52:20,472
I started off on the wrong button.

684
00:52:20,472 --> 00:52:23,158
It looks funny.

685
00:52:23,158 --> 00:52:28,417
It does, right? If you start off on the wrong button, it looks weird.

686
00:52:28,932 --> 00:52:33,484
- What should I do then?
- You can unbutton it and do it again.

687
00:52:33,484 --> 00:52:35,878
You're right.

688
00:52:37,379 --> 00:52:44,684
Mom and Dad stepped off on the
wrong foot just like this button.

689
00:52:44,684 --> 00:52:49,400
We both are going to start over
at different houses separately.

690
00:52:49,400 --> 00:52:52,028
Are you guys splitting up?

691
00:52:52,028 --> 00:52:55,770
Yeah. It's called a divorce.

692
00:52:55,770 --> 00:52:57,926
Then what about me?

693
00:52:57,926 --> 00:53:01,600
It's not going to be different for you.
You will live with me.

694
00:53:01,600 --> 00:53:04,251
And Dad will come here to hang out with you.

695
00:53:04,251 --> 00:53:08,918
So he was being nice to me
because he's getting a divorce?

696
00:53:10,510 --> 00:53:14,255
He felt sorry that he didn't
get to hang out with you.

697
00:53:14,255 --> 00:53:23,495
He can get a divorce if he comes here to play with me more often. I can still live with you.

698
00:53:55,646 --> 00:53:59,997
My temperature shouldn't
be too high or too low.

699
00:53:59,997 --> 00:54:03,839
- Why is that?
- Because hail can't be made.

700
00:54:05,280 --> 00:54:07,588
You're good, honey.

701
00:54:12,627 --> 00:54:14,015
Hello?

702
00:54:14,015 --> 00:54:15,881
I want to speak to Tae Hyun.

703
00:54:17,028 --> 00:54:20,043
I told him about us.

704
00:54:20,043 --> 00:54:22,802
Tae Hyun, it's Dad.

705
00:54:22,802 --> 00:54:25,595
- Dad.
- Hey, buddy.

706
00:54:25,595 --> 00:54:32,869
- What were you doing?
- I was reading a book about hail.

707
00:54:32,869 --> 00:54:39,330
- Tae Hyun, I'm not going to die.
- I know. I heard from Mom.

708
00:54:39,330 --> 00:54:43,070
I'm going to spend more time with you now.

709
00:54:43,070 --> 00:54:46,877
Could you go to a sledge park with me?

710
00:54:48,028 --> 00:54:51,563
If you want, I'll take you anywhere.

711
00:54:51,563 --> 00:54:56,446
I'm okay with a divorce.
So don't worry about me.

712
00:54:56,446 --> 00:54:59,982
Okay, good night.

713
00:54:59,982 --> 00:55:07,792
You too. I love you Daddy.
I learned this at kindergarten.

714
00:55:09,234 --> 00:55:12,060
Okay. Good night.

715
00:55:12,686 --> 00:55:15,259
You too.

716
00:55:31,168 --> 00:55:34,124
I went to your marital house with Mrs. Ha.

717
00:55:35,149 --> 00:55:37,798
I kind of yelled at Jung Hoon yesterday.

718
00:55:37,798 --> 00:55:43,972
I told him to fix the problem, and his mom said
she will do the interior design for the house.

719
00:55:44,358 --> 00:55:47,206
You still have the money that you borrowed
from the bank, right? Give it back to the bank.

720
00:55:47,206 --> 00:55:49,845
All we have to do is buy furniture.
We can buy them with money I have.

721
00:55:49,845 --> 00:55:53,219
Listen to me.

722
00:55:55,560 --> 00:55:57,125
What's wrong?

723
00:55:57,125 --> 00:55:59,264
You didn't even have dinner.
What's wrong?
